== Problem Statement

- beginner producers are overwhelmed with buttons and dials, without any explanation
- beginners must learn complex concepts before getting started with creative expression, causing friction and fatigue
- experienced producers often get stuck in a creative block when they use the same environment repeatedly
- a new way to make sounds may help a producer express themselves creatively and get out of a block

